      "writtenOn": "2014-07-28T23:16:19Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "but a V2 token is implicitly scoped to the default domain; given this is being exposed on the v3 API, i\u0027m wondering if it makes sense to convey that here?",
      "revId": "ba96cfe510541ac4528921f303ff76134aa3a2b0",
      "serverId": "4a232e18-c5a9-48ee-94c0-e04e7cca6543",
